//! The `overscroll-behavior-inline` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! sets the browser's behavior when the inline direction boundary of a scrolling area is reached.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
